th conditions, prevention and treatment options, treatment adherence, and personal behaviours that can affect health outcomes","kind":"task","esco_uri":null,"sources":[{"source":"ilo","ref":"3259-2","via":"3259","match":"bls_crosswalk","w":1}],"n_sources":1,"weight":1,"ai":{"pct":0.595,"anthropic_penetration":null,"ilo_2025":0.33,"basis":"direct"},"robotics":null},{"id":"29-2099.08#16","text":"Administering therapeutic care and treatment to patients;\r\n(d ) performing certain basic clinical procedures, such as administration of HIV antibody tests or insertion of intrauterine devices","kind":"task","esco_uri":null,"sources":[{"source":"ilo","ref":"3259-3","via":"3259","match":"bls_crosswalk","w":1}],"n_sources":1,"weight":1,"ai":{"pct":0.086,"anthropic_penetration":null,"ilo_2025":0.116,"basis":"direct"},"robotics":null},{"id":"29-2099.08#17","text":"Dispensing and advising on dietary supplements, antiretroviral and prophylaxis medications, and other healthcare products","kind":"task","esco_uri":null,"sources":[{"source":"ilo","ref":"3259-4","via":"3259","match":"bls_crosswalk","w":1}],"n_sources":1,"weight":1,"ai":{"pct":0.629,"anthropic_penetration":null,"ilo_2025":0.3475,"basis":"direct"},"robotics":null},{"id":"29-2099.08#18","text":"Monitoring patients' progress through treatment plans, and identifying signs and symptoms requiring referral to a medical doctor or other health professional","kind":"task","esco_uri":null,"sources":[{"source":"ilo","ref":"3259-5","via":"3259","match":"bls_crosswalk","w":1}],"n_sources":1,"weight":1,"ai":{"pct":0.42,"anthropic_penetration":null,"ilo_2025":0.2475,"basis":"direct"},"robotics":null},{"id":"29-2099.08#19","text":"Recording information on patients' health status and responses to treatment in medical records-keeping systems","kind":"task","esco_uri":null,"sources":[{"source":"ilo","ref":"3259-6","via":"3259","match":"bls_crosswalk","w":1}],"n_sources":1,"weight":1,"ai":{"pct":0.944,"anthropic_penetration":null,"ilo_2025":